      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="v2_lead"><code class="font-code text-base">draw</code> animates a stroke from nothing to complete; the element needs a stroke and no fill. <code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-svg-fill="true"</code> fades the fill in after the line is done, the usual move for line-art icons. Put <code class="font-code text-base">draw</code> on a group and every shape inside it draws.</p>
