    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="v5_title">Along a path, into a new shape.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="v5_lead"><code class="font-code text-base">along-path</code> sends a shape along <code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-svg-path</code>, turned to face its direction. <code class="font-code text-base">morph</code> tweens a path from its own outline to the one in <code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-svg-to</code>; it reads cleanest when the two paths have a similar structure.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="grid cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 py-14">

